spice
* NMOS Amplifier Circuit
VDD 3 0 DC <value>  ; Define the voltage value for VDD
RD 3 2 <value>      ; Define the resistor value for RD
M1 2 1 0 0 NMOS     ; NMOS (Drain=2, Gate=1, Source=0, Body=0)
* Input/Output connections
Vin 1 0 DC <value>  ; Define the voltage level for Vin
? Missing component
.model NMOS NMOS    ; Model parameters may be required
.END
